OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIsolated, possibly heavy,
OL,6,Fshowers are expected through the day,
OL,7,Fchiefly towards the north and west.
OL,8,FHowever, many places staying dry with
OL,9,Fbright or sunny spells. Temperatures
OL,10,Faround average for the time of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FFurther showers will move in
OL,13,Ffrom the west overnight, some of which
OL,14,Fcould be heavy at times. More isolated
OL,15,Fin the east with clearer spells. A
OL,16,Fcooler night for many.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
