OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F171A1787109930
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA showery day on Thursday.
OL,6,FShowers turning thundery at times as
OL,7,Fthey move their way eastwards. Some
OL,8,Fhail possible too. Slightly cooler
OL,9,Fthan Wednesday, but warm in any sunny
OL,10,Fspells.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FTemperatures staying below average
OL,14,Finto the weekend. Scattered showers
OL,15,Fcontinuing on Friday, but slowly
OL,16,Fbecoming more settled again heading
OL,17,Finto the weekend with an increasing
OL,18,Fnumber of sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
